        "ROB_RAVAGER_BODY_TYPHOON_UNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESC": "使用Ravager通关游戏，或在Typhoon或Eclipse难度下抹除自己。\n<color=#8888>Typhoon及以上难度均可</color>",
        "ROB_RAVAGER_BODY_PUNCH_UNLOCKABLE_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Ravager: In a Trail of Fire",
